('الصف العاشر','اللغة الإنجليزية','Unit 1: Making contact','Making contact','UNIT
Making contact
Hello Basim,
You don’t know me, but my dad gave me your email address. You see, he’s in contact with your father
because he’s joining your dad’s farm research project next month.
I’m writing now as I’d love to get to know you and also learn about Palestine. Then I hope to visit in
the winter holidays. (They start on 23rd December and finish on 9th January.) Please write back!
Best wishes,
Jenny Scott
PS I’m attaching a photo of a boat race I was in.
NEW EMAIL
