Good evening and welcome to
today’s World Weather report.
Well, the weather’s been even
busier and even more exciting than
usual, especially in North America
and Asia!
As we move into the early summer,
temperatures have been rising more quickly than
normal and this is producing dangerous weather
conditions. Let’s start in South Asia with the Himalayas.
Here in the world’s highest, most dramatic mountains, snow and
ice are melting earlier and faster than usual and this is causing more avalanches. And as melting
continues, enormous quantities of water are entering the great rivers of India and Bangladesh.
These are already rising and causing floods.
a
